		(property "Description" "Raspberry Pi Pico / Pico W / Pico 2 W socket, header for pins 1-20. HALF of the socket - pair with noknok_Pico_Socket_P21-40, placed 17.78 mm away, same rotation. This half carries the antenna keep-out and the board outline in its footprint. GND pins 3/8/13/18 are stacked at the bottom: all four exist and must be soldered, they are drawn overlapping so the group is wired once."
